TASK-191.4 runtime harness: typed URLs and links clicked in a page, routed by
Air Traffic Control. Temporary code, never committed to Detour/. It logs to
$DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR/verify-<phase>.log every routing question the window asks
(CLICK: window, space, entry, modifiers, gesture, Peek, page, target,
eligibility, decision), every palette submission (TYPED / TYPED-DECISION),
every placement (PLACE) and window/space/tab dumps (STATE). It seeds spaces
Work and Personal, routes (contains "secret" -> Private window; domainIs
localhost -> Work; contains "kind=blank-work" -> Work; contains "routeme" ->
Work; Default Most Recent Space), window B on Work, window A on Personal with
a pinned tab (anchor 127.0.0.1/a?tag=pin) and the links page, and reads
commands appended to cmd-<phase>.txt: click/clickpeek <win> <element id>
[cmd+shift+opt] (real mouse events through NSApp.postEvent, at the element's
rect read from the page), cmdt/cmdl/type/clear/return/escape <win> (real key
events), load/newtab/select/front/private/name/eval/dump/wait/capture.
Input lands only in the key window of the active app: a plain click posted
to an inactive window is swallowed (a Cmd-click is not, which is why only the
Cmd-clicks landed in the first run while the user was in another app), so
every input command first activates Detour and makes its window key, and
retries until it is.

Fixture: fixture/server.py (below) on 127.0.0.1:8714 and on [::1]:8714
(python3 -I server.py 8714; python3 -I server.py 8714 v6), sandbox off. The
page is reached as 127.0.0.1 and as localhost (two hosts for the cross-host
rule; localhost is routed to Work) and [::1] (a cross host with no route).
No download links; nothing audible.

    SP=<scratch>; mkdir -p $SP/out
    git apply docs/harness/task191-4-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    DETOUR_DATA_DIR=DetourVerify1914 DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR=$SP/out DETOUR_VERIFY_PHASE=1 \
        .derived/Build/Products/Debug/Detour.app/Contents/MacOS/Detour &
    watch-captures.sh &            # screencapture -x -o -l <n> for each CAPTURE line
    cp cmd-1.txt $SP/out/          # then append the reruns
    git apply -R docs/harness/task191-4-harness.patch && xcodegen generate

